      "stepByStep": "1. Equate efficiencies: $1 - \\frac{T}{900} = 1 - \\frac{400}{T}$.\n2. $\\frac{T}{900} = \\frac{400}{T} \\implies T^2 = 900 \\times 400 = 360000$.\n3. Take square root: $T = \\sqrt{360000} = 600\\text{ K}$.",
